		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Acid Shell</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — A corrosive firearm round that Sunders armor.</em></p><p><strong>2 Actions · Requires Firearm.</strong> Range 6, Blast 3, Damage: STRd4. On damage: inflict Sundered. Affected targets can spend an action to remove the condition.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> On damage: inflict Sundered for 2 attacks.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> Acid damage you deal ignores Medium Armor.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Rolls STRd4 damage.</em></p><p><em>[M] Sundered lasts for 2 attacks — track it yourself.</em></p>",
